      {
        "claim_id": "weaponized_capitol_bombs_claim_0094",
        "source": "weaponized_capitol_bombs",
        "text": "[06:32 - 06:40] And he's inserted this huge amendment, basically, which provides a UAP review board,\n[06:40 - 06:48] which will basically look to release UAP reports going back decades."
